# Canonical production origin (no trailing slash).
#
# Used for metadataBase, canonical URLs, Open Graph URLs, sitemap.xml and
# robots.txt. Copy this file to `.env.local` and set the real domain, or set it
# as an environment variable on the host.
#
# If it is left empty:
#   - local builds fall back to http://localhost:3000,
#   - every page is marked `noindex, nofollow`,
#   - robots.txt disallows crawling and the sitemap stays empty.
# That keeps preview deployments out of search results until a real domain is
# configured. A reserved placeholder such as `https://glowbound.example.com` is
# rejected on purpose.
#
# On Vercel, VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL is used automatically when this
# variable is absent; setting it explicitly is still recommended.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=
